{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the evocative soundtrack of <strong>Orbyss</strong>, crafted by renowned composer <strong>Pierre Est\u00e8ve</strong>, celebrated for his work on the <i>Atlantis</i> series and other acclaimed video game scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending deep electronic textures, organic soundscapes, and abstract melodies, this soundtrack captures the emotional arc of the game \u2014 from the resonant echoes of the abyss, through storms of energy and moments of harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed as both a companion to the gameplay and a standalone musical journey, Pierre Est\u00e8ve\u2019s compositions invite you to relive the game\u2019s most striking moments, or simply lose yourself in a world where light and sound tell the story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890470?t=1758715956","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890470?t=1758715956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890470/eefac4c877468e41208d5de8b02bbb406e545a58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758715956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890470/eefac4c877468e41208d5de8b02bbb406e545a58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758715956","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the evocative soundtrack of <strong>Orbyss</strong>, crafted by renowned composer <strong>Pierre Est\u00e8ve</strong>, celebrated for his work on the <i>Atlantis</i> series and other acclaimed video game scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending deep electronic textures, organic soundscapes, and abstract melodies, this soundtrack captures the emotional arc of the game \u2014 from the resonant echoes of the abyss, through storms of ene